            "icon": "check_box",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Hot flashes can be a major disruption. Shilajit, the potent Ayurvedic remedy supports menopausal women by reducing hot flashes, allowing you to feel more at ease and ready to embrace your vitality.</p>",
