            "row_content": "<p>This may hinder your confidence in the bedroom. </p><p>Pure Himalayan Shilajit Gold’s clinically-studied botanicals, adaptogens & vitamins help alleviate decreased libido, hot flashes and hormonal weight gain, so you get back to feeling like you.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
