    "collapsible_content_HkG9n6": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_zC6Czf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "When can I experience results from Shilajit Essential Extract?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<ol><li>Everyone's body is unique so individual results may vary. While some customers may start seeing results as early as 2 weeks, it typically takes up to 8-12 weeks for body \"charges\" enough trace minerals.</li><li>This is why we recommend trying the 3-jar bundle in order to enjoy the full benefits.</li><li>However, within the first few consumptions, customers may experience:</li></ol><ul><li>Waking up energized in the mornings</li><li>An easier time moving around</li><li>More regular bathroom visits</li><li>Greater mindfulness of eating in between meals</li><li>Staying cool & dry more often</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_qrGA9d": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "I’m lucky enough to be able to maintain my shape during menopause. Is Shilajit Essential Extract I’m lucky enough to be able to maintain my shape during menopause. Is Shilajit Essential Extract still useful for me?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<ol><li>Definitely! Different women take Shilajit Essential Extract for different needs.</li><li>Some take it for supporting healthy digestion, some take it for their joint health, and there are some that take it for support in managing hot flashes.</li><li>The bottom line? Most of our customers have found Shilajit Essential Extract to be useful in supporting a smooth transition during menopause.</li></ol>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_rmQF7P": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will Shilajit Essential Extract work for me if I’m not dieting or working out?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<ul><li>Here's one thing we want to make very clear:</li><li>Shilajit Essential Extract is NOT a magic pill.</li><li>It was formulated to be a menopause SUPPORT supplement - that provides women with a natural way to get more out of their diets and exercise.</li><li>A reasonable amount of exercise & being mindful of what you eat is required in order to fully unlock the benefits of Shilajit Essential Extract</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_trmaKd": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does Shilajit Essential Extract contain gluten, soy, peanuts, dairy, shellfish or any other allergens?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<ol><li>Shilajit Essential Extract is not known to have any major side effects.</li><li>Shilajit Essential Extract is made using high quality, natural ingredients from highest altitude of Himalayas and has been tested safe for consumption in every batch of production, randomly. It was formulated to be stimulant-free, which makes it ideal for long-term consumption.</li><li>Because of its high potency, some customers may occasionally experience mild bloating at the start. This is normal and usually goes away after a few days as your body is adjusting.</li><li>But if you experience adverse effects, please stop consumption and consult a doctor. If you are on medication or suffer from health conditions, we recommend informing your doctor your interest in consuming our supplements.</li><li>In general, you should follow the recommended 1 pea-size spoon a day. Many customers following this dosage have feedbacked experiencing <strong>more sustained effects </strong>like better weight management, reduced inflammatory pain and improved gut health especially when taken in the long term.</li></ol>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Gz6jXJ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Could Shilajit Essential Extract aid in weight loss?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Incorporating our Shilajit Essential Extract regularly into your regimen as a weight management supplement can assist in a multitude of ways. Even though it may seem like a contemporary trend, it has been an enduring weight loss solution since ancient times!</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_Wd7pbe": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How Is Your Shilajit Purified?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Wellness Nest's Shilajit is purified using the ancient method called \"SURYA TAPI\"..</p><p>What is <strong>SURYA TAPI?</strong></p><p>SURYA TAPI means<strong> Sun Dried</strong>..</p><p>It's the <strong>most natural method of purifying Shilajit</strong>, and it's also the <strong>best way to preserve Shilajit's potency, minerals & vitamins.</strong></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_A6KEAL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can men use Shilajit Essential Extract too?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Indeed, Shilajit Essential Extract isn't gender-specific – it's a supplement for all humans! Shilajit Essential Extract offers benefits including masculinity enhancement, immune system support, digestive health, and much more. It's packed with over 84 essential minerals and vitamins.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_DTYQLU": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is Shilajit Essential Extract safe? Can shilajit interact with medications or existing health conditions?",
            "icon": "quiz",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Shilajit is generally considered<strong>safe for most people when used appropriately.  </strong>However, like any supplement, it's essential to use it responsibly and consult with a healthcare professional before starting, especially if you have any underlying health conditions or are taking medications.</p><p>While shilajit is known for its potential health benefits, it can interact with certain medications or existing health conditions. For example, it may interact with blood pressure medications, diabetes medications, or medications that affect blood clotting. </p><p>Additionally, individuals with certain health conditions, such as kidney disorders, should exercise caution when using shilajit.</p><p>To ensure your safety, it's crucial to discuss any concerns or potential interactions with your healthcare provider before incorporating shilajit into your routine. They can provide personalized guidance based on your individual health status and medication regimen.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
